          "message": "feat(canon): constrained ground-triple-term (error-on-nested-bnode) rdf12 variant (sq-iaxd) [FABLE-5] (#1931)\n\nOpt-in rdf12-triple-terms ground-term wrapper: fails closed with CanonError::NestedBlankNode unless every triple term is blank-node-free, else exact RDFC-1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
